                },
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Province of Flevoland"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Infrastructure — Regular Infrastructure Projects"
                  }
